III.
General Comments on Platform Differences.

The .save files are from an x86_64 platform and with gfortran:
Linux 3.10.0-693.21.1.el7.x86_64 #1 SMP Fri Feb 23 18:54:16 UTC 2018 x86_64 x86_64 x86_64 GNU/Linux
Red Hat Enterprise Linux Server release 7.4 (Maipo)
gcc version 4.8.5 20150623 (Red Hat 4.8.5-16) (GCC) 

Other operating systems and other compilers tend to show differences mainly
in floating point arithmetic.

32 bit platforms tend to show more differences and due to more causes including
floating point arithmetic, binary file formats, and memory layout.
